row\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Phone:</span>\n          <span>{{ $json.phone }}</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"info-row\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Server Location:</span>\n          <span>{{ $json.server_location }}</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"info-row\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Request Time:</span>\n          <span>{{ $json.timestamp }}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"info-box\" style=\"border-left-color: #F59E0B;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: #F59E0B; margin-top: 0;\">⏱️ What Happens Next?</h3>\n        <ol style=\"padding-left: 20px;\">\n          <li><strong>Within 2 Hours:</strong> Our team will provision your Odoo instance on {{ $json.server_location }} server</li>\n          <li><strong>Within 24 Hours:</strong> You'll receive login credentials and setup instructions</li>\n          <li><strong>4 Weeks Free:</strong> Full access to enterprise-grade Odoo ERP with AI automation</li>\n          <li><strong>Ongoing Support:</strong> Our experts will guide you through setup and optimization</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n        <a href=\"https://scholarixglobal.com/odoo-trial\" class=\"cta-button\" style=\"color: white;\">📚 View Getting Started Guide</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"info-box\" style=\"border-left-color: #1E3A8A; background: #E0F2FE;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: #1E3A8A; margin-top: 0;\">✨ Your Trial Includes:</h3>\n        <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px;\">\n          <li>✅ Enterprise-grade Odoo ERP platform</li>\n          <li>✅ AI automation tools and workflows</li>\n          <li>✅ Dedicated server resources</li>\n          <li>✅ Technical support and onboarding</li>\n          <li>✅ No credit card required</li>\n          <li>✅ No obligation to continue</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><strong>Questions?</strong> Reply to this email or call us at <a href=\"tel: